  <jpcrp_cor:NotesRegardingNewShareSubscriptionRightsEtcTextBlock contextRef="Prior1YearDuration">&lt;p class="smt_text6" style="orphans:0;widows:0;text-align:justify;padding-left:9pt;padding-right:0pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;text-indent:0pt;font-family:&amp;apos;ＭＳ ゴシック&amp;apos;;letter-spacing:0pt;line-height:15pt;font-size:9pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-family:&amp;apos;ＭＳ 明朝&amp;apos;;"&gt;２．新株予約権等に関する事項&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class="smt_text6" style="orphans:0;widows:0;text-align:justify;padding-left:18pt;padding-right:0pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;text-indent:0pt;font-family:&amp;apos;ＭＳ ゴシック&amp;apos;;letter-spacing:0pt;line-height:15pt;font-size:9pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-family:&amp;apos;ＭＳ 明朝&amp;apos;;"&gt;該当事項はありません。&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class="smt_text6" style="orphans:0;widows:0;text-align:justify;padding-left:9pt;padding-right:0pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;text-indent:0pt;font-family:&amp;apos;ＭＳ ゴシック&amp;apos;;letter-spacing:0pt;line-height:15pt;font-size:15pt;"&gt; &lt;/p&gt;</jpcrp_cor:NotesRegardingNewShareSubscriptionRightsEtcTextBlock>
  <jpcrp_cor:NotesRegardingIssuedSharesAndTreasurySharesTextBlock contextRef="CurrentYearDuration">&lt;p class="smt_text6" style="orphans:0;widows:0;text-align:justify;padding-left:9pt;padding-right:0pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;text-indent:0pt;font-family:&amp;apos;ＭＳ 明朝&amp;apos;;letter-spacing:0pt;line-height:15pt;"&gt;当連結会計年度(自  &lt;span&gt;2023年３月１日&lt;/span&gt;  至  &lt;span&gt;2024年２月29日&lt;/span&gt;)&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class="smt_text6" style="orphans:0;widows:0;text-align:justify;padding-left:9pt;padding-right:0pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;text-indent:0pt;font-family:&amp;apos;ＭＳ 明朝&amp;apos;;letter-spacing:0pt;line-height:15pt;"&gt;１．発行済株式の種類及び総数並びに自己株式の種類及び株式数に関する事項&lt;/p&gt;
